WEBVTT

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.270
There's no going back to those days,

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:26.819
but I swear that now,
I'll beat out your sorrow

00:00:28.321 --> 00:00:31.073
| may not overcome it unharmed,

00:00:31.157 --> 00:00:35.912
exhaustively marking the footprints

00:00:35.995 --> 00:00:39.916
of the journey to meet you again

00:00:39.999 --> 00:00:45.755
You once taught me that

00:00:45.838 --> 00:00:51.594
the pounding of the heart
is what drives us on

00:00:51.677 --> 00:00:57.600
They haven't taken our future away,

00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:02.271
and knowing that, I can go on

00:01:02.355 --> 00:01:03.564
Just go on

00:01:03.648 --> 00:01:10.404
As long as you smile,
as long as you can sing,

00:01:10.488 --> 00:01:14.575
that becomes everything that I desire

00:01:14.659 --> 00:01:15.284
Wow

00:01:15.326 --> 00:01:22.083
The courage you've given me,
the kindness you've shown me,

00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:28.297
gives me the strength
to look forward and walk on

00:01:40.184 --> 00:01:41.310
Who's there?!

00:01:44.021 --> 00:01:45.314
Syaoran...

00:01:48.985 --> 00:01:50.569
Syaoran...

00:01:50.653 --> 00:01:52.446
That voice...

00:02:06.002 --> 00:02:07.795
Syaoran...

00:02:14.176 --> 00:02:15.678
Syaoran!

00:02:22.018 --> 00:02:24.270
I-It was a dream...

00:02:24.353 --> 00:02:27.315
You were having a nightmare. Are you okay?

00:02:29.317 --> 00:02:31.902
No need to worry, Mokona.

00:02:31.986 --> 00:02:33.946
Oh, that's good.

00:03:23.662 --> 00:03:26.749
| went and woke up Syaoran!

00:03:26.832 --> 00:03:29.251
Good work, Moko-chan.

00:03:29.335 --> 00:03:32.588
Good morning, Syaoran-kun.

00:03:32.671 --> 00:03:34.590
Good morning.

00:03:34.673 --> 00:03:36.592
You're late, kid.

00:03:36.675 --> 00:03:41.097
It's unusual for you
to oversleep, Syaoran-kun.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:42.139
Mekyo!

00:03:46.018 --> 00:03:47.603
It's you...

00:03:47.686 --> 00:03:49.271
The dimensional witch.

00:03:49.355 --> 00:03:55.236
Long time no see. You two
don't seem to have changed any,

00:03:55.319 --> 00:03:58.239
but Princess Sakura,
you're looking much better, huh?

00:03:58.322 --> 00:03:59.240
Yes.

00:03:59.323 --> 00:04:03.244
That's because Syaoran is working
so hard to collect her feathers.

00:04:03.327 --> 00:04:06.580
I'm only doing what
| made up my mind to do.

00:04:06.664 --> 00:04:10.251
You haven't changed.

00:04:10.334 --> 00:04:14.296
No, on the contrary,
you're stronger than you were before.

00:04:15.673 --> 00:04:19.510
| beg you, please help Sakura!

00:04:24.014 --> 00:04:27.601
| just want to go back to
the world that I came from.

00:04:27.685 --> 00:04:30.271
And I don't want to go
back to the world that I--

00:04:30.354 --> 00:04:32.606
You two notwithstanding,

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:35.234
Princess Sakura, you look
like you want to say something.

00:04:35.317 --> 00:04:38.571
Um, what was his compensation?

00:04:38.654 --> 00:04:41.907
That's something you don't need to know.

00:04:41.991 --> 00:04:44.577
Never mind that, how goes the journey?

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:48.247
I'm sure it would have been
hard if I had gone alone.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:52.460
But since everyone else is with me...

00:04:56.005 --> 00:04:58.257
By the way, Dimensional Witch,

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.759
do you have some sort
of important business,

00:05:00.843 --> 00:05:02.970
to be contacting us like this?

00:05:04.013 --> 00:05:05.931
It's White Day.

00:05:06.015 --> 00:05:10.269
You mean that one thing that
Mokona told us about, right?

00:05:10.352 --> 00:05:13.105
That's right.
In the world where Yuko lives,

00:05:13.189 --> 00:05:17.234
if you get chocolate on Valentine's Day,
you give something back.

00:05:17.318 --> 00:05:19.570
And that's called "White Day," right?

00:05:19.653 --> 00:05:20.905
Uh-huh.

00:05:20.988 --> 00:05:22.907
| don't know what you mean.

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:27.244
We'll be sure to pay you back for
the Fondant au Chocolat we got earlier.

00:05:27.328 --> 00:05:28.913
Just you wait, okay?

00:05:28.996 --> 00:05:30.664
I'm looking forward to it.

00:05:30.748 --> 00:05:34.335
But never mind that, what sort
of place are you all in right now?

00:05:34.418 --> 00:05:38.255
We're currently in a world
named "Piffle World."

00:05:38.339 --> 00:05:41.258
We've all ended up taking
part in a race here.

00:05:41.342 --> 00:05:42.635
A race?

00:05:53.687 --> 00:05:56.941
Even the witch was surprised, huh?

00:05:57.024 --> 00:05:59.985
We were taken aback at first, too.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.620
Princess, look!

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:14.917
The winner will be rewarded with
this feather, which holds power enough

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:19.922
to provide the amount of electricity
required to run this whole city!

00:06:20.005 --> 00:06:22.925
Come, you racers who have the nerve to try,

00:06:23.008 --> 00:06:27.972
win the upcoming Dragonfly Race,
and get this feather!

00:06:35.688 --> 00:06:39.441
Fai and Kuro-rin are both
getting good at piloting, huh?

00:06:39.525 --> 00:06:41.902
| have to do my best, too.

00:06:41.986 --> 00:06:44.572
Syaoran-kun, may I pilot?

00:06:44.655 --> 00:06:46.907
Please be careful, okay?

00:06:46.991 --> 00:06:47.950
Right.

00:06:49.994 --> 00:06:52.830
Princess, like I showed you earlier...

00:06:58.002 --> 00:06:59.587
What are those guys doing?

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:01.714
Oh, dear, it looks like
they're coming this way.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:10.973
D Spinning... spinning...
I'm like a paper balloon... )

00:07:18.022 --> 00:07:19.940
Kuro-rin, you're a good driver.

00:07:20.024 --> 00:07:23.902
This is easy, compared to a horse.

00:07:23.986 --> 00:07:27.239
| thought we were going to die back there.

00:07:27.323 --> 00:07:28.907
I'm sorry.

00:07:28.991 --> 00:07:31.577
It's my fault for not teaching her better.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.580
That would have been
fatal during the real thing.

00:07:34.663 --> 00:07:38.584
The race is going to be a wild one,
considering what the prize is.

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:40.919
Are you sure you want to enter?

00:07:41.003 --> 00:07:44.256
Princess, I can do whatever
it takes to get the feather.

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:48.927
I'll lend a hand, too.
And Kuro-sama, too, of course.

00:07:49.011 --> 00:07:52.598
So Sakura-chan, you don't have
to push yourself to enter the race.

00:07:52.681 --> 00:07:54.266
Thank you very much.

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:59.647
But if there's anything
that I can do, I want to try.

00:08:05.986 --> 00:08:08.238
Not changing their minds after having spoken

00:08:08.322 --> 00:08:10.616
is the same for princesses everywhere.

00:08:14.328 --> 00:08:16.038
Why, you... Watch out...

00:08:19.333 --> 00:08:20.793
Princess Tomoyo?

00:08:23.003 --> 00:08:24.963
Kurogane-san!

00:08:31.679 --> 00:08:33.305
Just a moment.

00:08:47.695 --> 00:08:49.154
| have found you!

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:55.285
You are my heroine!

00:09:05.838 --> 00:09:07.923
Allow me to offer my greetings once again.

00:09:08.006 --> 00:09:13.929
| am the president of Piffle
Princess Company, Tomoyo Daidoji.

00:09:14.012 --> 00:09:17.266
She's the company president. Amazing.

00:09:17.349 --> 00:09:19.601
By any chance, is that race...

00:09:19.685 --> 00:09:23.272
Yes, my company is sponsoring it.

00:09:23.355 --> 00:09:26.275
As the promoter, I have
decided to record the whole race,

00:09:26.358 --> 00:09:28.944
from the exciting start,

00:09:29.027 --> 00:09:34.992
right up to the last moment,
when they wave the checkered flag!

00:09:37.494 --> 00:09:42.791
For that reason, I need a heroine
to enter the race for me.

00:09:46.003 --> 00:09:48.964
And that, Sakura-san, will be you!

00:10:07.357 --> 00:10:09.109
Sakura's looking good!

00:10:09.193 --> 00:10:11.278
Almost like a different person from earlier.

00:10:11.361 --> 00:10:13.822
Her motivation is different, after all.

00:10:16.992 --> 00:10:17.951
Princess!

00:10:21.997 --> 00:10:22.915
Princess!

00:10:22.998 --> 00:10:25.125
She is even cute when she takes a spill!

00:10:37.346 --> 00:10:42.351
Dragonflies do have some power,
but mostly, they operate on wind.

00:10:42.434 --> 00:10:45.270
So you must always be
reading the winds with these.

00:10:45.354 --> 00:10:46.605
Okay.

00:10:46.688 --> 00:10:49.274
Once you read the wind, you turn the wheel.

00:10:49.358 --> 00:10:51.610
Like this, right?

00:10:51.693 --> 00:10:53.987
Doing it slowly will be fine.

00:10:57.991 --> 00:10:59.910
E-Excuse me!

00:10:59.993 --> 00:11:01.954
Mm-mm, I'm sorry.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:05.249
La-La, lovey-lovey!

00:11:05.332 --> 00:11:09.253
Sakura-chan seems more
cheerful than before, huh?

00:11:09.336 --> 00:11:10.921
Yeah.

00:11:11.004 --> 00:11:12.923
It's heartwarming, isn't it?

00:11:13.006 --> 00:11:14.258
Sure.

00:11:14.341 --> 00:11:16.134
| mean you, Kuro-tan.

00:11:17.344 --> 00:11:21.139
You were cute when you
recognized Tomoyo-chan.

00:11:22.683 --> 00:11:25.936
Still, it happens a lot, huh?

00:11:26.019 --> 00:11:29.606
The person may look the same,
but they aren't.

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:32.484
You don't seem to have met them yet, huh?

00:11:34.027 --> 00:11:36.989
The reason why you have
to keep running away.

00:11:46.999 --> 00:11:48.584
Having the same face

00:11:48.667 --> 00:11:51.587
doesn't necessarily make
them the same person.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:53.589
| know.

00:11:53.672 --> 00:11:56.925
Do they just have the same face?

00:11:57.009 --> 00:12:00.596
Or is it really that person?

00:12:00.679 --> 00:12:02.514
| would know.

00:12:07.352 --> 00:12:10.147
Kuro-tan, you would know
if it's Princess Tomoyo, huh?

00:12:29.666 --> 00:12:32.628
| must see through to the end...

00:12:35.005 --> 00:12:37.299
...the outcome of this miracle.

00:12:51.438 --> 00:12:57.277
They go to other worlds, where
different people have the same faces...

00:12:57.361 --> 00:13:00.280
That must be what they think.

00:13:00.364 --> 00:13:05.160
They would never realize
that they have met them before.

00:13:07.329 --> 00:13:11.124
The next move is yours.

00:13:36.024 --> 00:13:38.610
And so, the Dragonfly Race is about to start!

00:13:38.694 --> 00:13:40.612
Perhaps owing to the grand prize,

00:13:40.696 --> 00:13:43.323
there are more entrants
than ever this time around!

00:13:44.992 --> 00:13:48.245
However, unless you are ranked in
the top twelve in this preliminary,

00:13:48.328 --> 00:13:50.956
you will be unable to advance to the main race!

00:14:04.011 --> 00:14:06.930
Seems like there are a lot of people
here that we've seen before, huh?

00:14:07.014 --> 00:14:08.640
Y-Yeah...

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:11.476
Is that...

00:14:15.022 --> 00:14:16.231
Ryuo!

00:14:19.026 --> 00:14:22.487
| guess not, huh? Not in this world.

00:14:25.991 --> 00:14:29.619
There really are a lot
of familiar faces, huh?

00:14:31.997 --> 00:14:34.249
Waving the checkered flag
for the preliminary race

00:14:34.332 --> 00:14:36.918
is the pride of Piffle World's
own general trading company,

00:14:37.002 --> 00:14:42.591
the Piffle Princess Company's young
president, Miss Tomoyo Daidoji!

00:14:42.674 --> 00:14:45.635
Ladies and gentlemen, are you all ready?

00:15:00.358 --> 00:15:03.987
And so, the Dragonfly Race
preliminaries have started!

00:15:22.339 --> 00:15:24.591
Princess! Cut your engine!

00:15:24.674 --> 00:15:25.634
R-Right!

00:15:30.347 --> 00:15:35.018
If your controls stop working,
cut your engine, and use the wind.

00:15:35.102 --> 00:15:36.603
Got it.

00:15:36.686 --> 00:15:39.147
Okay, let's go.

00:15:40.357 --> 00:15:42.943
Sure enough, the regulars that have
ranked highest in previous races

00:15:43.026 --> 00:15:46.947
have taken the lead. And behind them,
giving desperate chase...

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:51.243
...are two newcomers,
the Tsubame, and the Kuro-tan!

00:15:51.326 --> 00:15:54.246
Why the hell did you put down that name?!

00:15:54.329 --> 00:15:57.249
| thought it would be better
to give you a cute name.

00:15:57.332 --> 00:15:59.584
Don't go goofing around
in the middle of the race!

00:15:59.668 --> 00:16:02.337
| guess you're right. Okay then...

00:16:04.673 --> 00:16:06.800
Take this seriously from the start, will you?!

00:16:13.348 --> 00:16:14.266
Princess!

00:16:14.349 --> 00:16:18.311
I'm all right. Never mind me, go on ahead!

00:16:19.855 --> 00:16:24.776
Fly as fast as you can.
I'll try as hard as I can, too.

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:25.986
Princess...

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:29.990
Right.

00:16:35.996 --> 00:16:39.916
As the sponsor, I have to be impartial,

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:43.587
but I would sure like for
that fantastic lady to win.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:47.257
The lead group will be
approaching the goal soon!

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:48.466
There they are!

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:08.069
Defying expectations, the two
newcomers make a one-two finish!

00:17:14.659 --> 00:17:18.580
That's my Kuro-samal!
First place is pretty cool.

00:17:18.663 --> 00:17:20.290
| suppose.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.794
Oh, dear. Looks like it's broken.

00:17:38.683 --> 00:17:39.935
Huh?

00:17:40.018 --> 00:17:41.269
What's that?

00:17:41.353 --> 00:17:42.979
It's Syaoran!

00:17:50.695 --> 00:17:52.614
What's the matter, Syaoran-kun?

00:17:52.697 --> 00:17:54.950
It looks like a foreign
object got into the engine.

00:17:55.033 --> 00:17:56.826
If I keep pushing the speed too hard...

00:17:59.663 --> 00:18:01.581
It appears that all of
the machines participating

00:18:01.665 --> 00:18:03.250
in the race are malfunctioning.

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:06.253
But there's nothing wrong with my machine.

00:18:06.336 --> 00:18:09.256
You've cut your engines several times,
so you've managed

00:18:09.339 --> 00:18:11.925
to keep your temperature
lower than the other machines.

00:18:12.008 --> 00:18:14.636
Syaoran, what will you do now?

00:18:20.684 --> 00:18:22.477
The same thing as the Princess.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:27.941
Princess, don't worry about me,
please go on ahead.

00:18:28.024 --> 00:18:29.192
Syaoran-kun...

00:18:32.696 --> 00:18:35.949
All right. But promise me one thing.

00:18:36.032 --> 00:18:38.576
Make sure you get through the preliminary.

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:39.911
Right.

00:18:39.995 --> 00:18:41.913
As of now, ten racers have
cleared the preliminary.

00:18:41.997 --> 00:18:44.249
However, having been
struck by sudden accidents,

00:18:44.332 --> 00:18:46.251
it is now utterly impossible
to make any predictions!

00:18:46.334 --> 00:18:51.923
And so, just who will be the last
two to get through the preliminary?!

00:18:52.007 --> 00:18:53.300
Who's this?

00:19:03.685 --> 00:19:06.271
| wonder if Syaoran is all right.

00:19:06.354 --> 00:19:10.608
Knowing Syaoran-kun, I'm sure he's fine.

00:19:10.692 --> 00:19:12.319
| can see it!

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:18.950
Guys, don't let anyone
else pass from here on!

00:19:19.034 --> 00:19:20.327
--Right!
- Right!

00:19:21.661 --> 00:19:22.620
Wait!

00:19:27.667 --> 00:19:29.919
Whoa, I can't watch.

00:19:30.003 --> 00:19:32.922
Hey, isn't that against the rules?

00:19:33.006 --> 00:19:37.594
As long as they don't hit anyone
directly, they won't be disqualified.

00:19:37.677 --> 00:19:41.931
At this rate, it's hopeless for
him to get past the preliminaries.

00:19:42.015 --> 00:19:46.269
But if he accelerates too hard,
it could cost him his life.

00:19:46.353 --> 00:19:48.605
Kuro-sama, what would you do?

00:19:48.688 --> 00:19:50.482
My answer...

00:19:51.691 --> 00:19:53.318
...is the same as the kid's.

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:07.248
Is he trying to get himself killed?!

00:20:07.332 --> 00:20:09.459
Eh, that goes for me, too!

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.133
Hang in there, Syaoran!

00:20:21.346 --> 00:20:24.307
I'm going to be the last one!

00:20:27.018 --> 00:20:29.979
You're going to be blown
to pieces at that rate!

00:20:32.357 --> 00:20:36.611
Give it up right now,
unless you'd rather die!

00:20:36.694 --> 00:20:40.615
I'm not going to die,
nor am I going to give up.

00:20:40.698 --> 00:20:43.284
W-What was that?

00:20:43.368 --> 00:20:48.164
| have something... that I must do.

00:21:01.678 --> 00:21:03.304
It's no use!

00:21:06.683 --> 00:21:07.851
Syaoran-kun!

00:21:17.026 --> 00:21:18.611
Syaoran-kun...

00:21:18.695 --> 00:21:21.656
No need to worry. See?

00:21:37.338 --> 00:21:41.259
Princess, I kept my promise.

00:21:41.342 --> 00:21:42.635
Mm-hmm.

00:21:46.681 --> 00:21:49.142
Oh, not at all bad, for you, kid.

00:22:02.363 --> 00:22:04.282
What's the matter?

00:22:04.365 --> 00:22:06.951
There isn't any physical harm to the racers,

00:22:07.035 --> 00:22:09.913
but these nanomachines react to
the heat of the Dragonfly engines,

00:22:09.996 --> 00:22:12.248
inflicting critical damage to them.

00:22:12.332 --> 00:22:14.584
There was nothing amiss in the vehicles

00:22:14.667 --> 00:22:17.587
during the check that was
conducted just before the race.

00:22:17.670 --> 00:22:22.967
Which means, someone
intentionally interfered with the race.

00:22:24.511 --> 00:22:26.971
Even worse, the culprit...

00:22:36.356 --> 00:22:37.649
The culprit...

00:22:39.359 --> 00:22:40.985
...is among them.

00:23:11.683 --> 00:23:18.982
You haven't yet realized

00:23:20.316 --> 00:23:28.908
that the two of us have the power
to change even yesterday

00:23:28.992 --> 00:23:33.246
For no reason, I'm lonely (lonely)

00:23:33.329 --> 00:23:37.917
With tears streaming down my face

00:23:38.001 --> 00:23:41.588
I'm missing my one and only (only)

00:23:41.671 --> 00:23:49.137
The one I trace out in the sky, and that's you

00:23:50.013 --> 00:23:55.268
Take my, take my hand,
and let's go on together,

00:23:55.351 --> 00:23:59.564
reach out, reach out your hand,
and catch hold of the wind,

00:23:59.647 --> 00:24:03.901
take my, take my hand,
and do not be afraid,

00:24:03.985 --> 00:24:11.576
hold my, hold my hand, and I can fly,

00:24:11.659 --> 00:24:16.748
when I'm with you

00:24:32.597 --> 00:24:33.514
Puu!

00:24:33.598 --> 00:24:35.433
After finishing the preliminary,
Syaoran and the others

00:24:35.516 --> 00:24:38.603
meet all sorts of people.
This guy, and that guy,

00:24:38.686 --> 00:24:42.940
they're all faces that they know.
But don't let your guard down!

00:24:43.024 --> 00:24:46.611
After all, one of them is the culprit
who interfered with the race.

00:24:46.694 --> 00:24:50.948
Which one is the suspect?
Just wait until you see!

00:24:51.032 --> 00:24:53.284
Tsubasa Chronicles, "The Three Badges."

00:24:53.368 --> 00:24:56.829
Next time, your heart will
pound over the Kuro-tan!
